> Because this here is a wonderful B profile. Here, I can see a [transcript gap] And here I can manage my entry. And now, I have a unique opportunity that otherwise wouldn't be possible for me if I were just selling the high. Here, I have a risk that is suddenly significantly and substantially reduced. — Source GPS: tS6ZEiHj8gQ | [MIDDLE] | Perfect Short Trade — Execution mode context: Primarily COUNTER-TRADE. B profile provides the structural reason to expect a return to lower prices. — Gap: Tom never formally defines what B profile stands for or its exact construction rules. It appears to be a balance profile formed after a directional move. — 2.1.2 P Profile = Acceptance, Continuation — Definition: A P profile (presumably a directional / trend profile) indicates acceptance at new prices and high probability of continuation. — How it works: — 
