> Now, here we have our range from our P. That's our P. And if I now see that we actually break out of this range to the downside, then I would definitely look for another position down here because then I'm quite confident that the market will wipe out the whole thing. — Source GPS: k0zm5NYn0IQ | [MIDDLE] | DAX Crash short — Execution mode context: Primarily TREND-CONTINUATION and BREAKOUT. P profile breaking = continuation or breakdown. — Gap: Tom never formally defines what P profile stands for. It appears to be a directional/trending profile. — 2.1.3 Balance-Heavy Profiles = No Directional Conviction — Definition: When volume profiles show balance (not directional), the market lacks conviction and is prone to reversal or range behavior. — How it works: — 
