> You can also see that in the delta here. It's decreasing — Source GPS: 4MoNjEQ2Dd8 | [END] | $2,350 in 40 Minutes — Execution mode context: TREND-CONTINUATION and BREAKOUT. Decreasing delta near resistance = caution, potential partial exit. — 2.3.5 Absorption = Buyer Catching Sells — Definition: Absorption occurs when a large buyer is catching all the sell orders at a price level, preventing further decline. — How it works: — 
