> here you can really see nicely how the market was absorbed at the bottom. — Source GPS: 4MoNjEQ2Dd8 | [MIDDLE] | $2,350 in 40 Minutes — 
> We can see how the market absorbed again. — Source GPS: 4MoNjEQ2Dd8 | [MIDDLE] | $2,350 in 40 Minutes — 
