ice timeframe is primary | LOW | Tom uses 1-min, 5-min, 15-min closes inconsistently. | — END SECTION 7 — Section 8: Source Index — All video IDs referenced in this file, with title and primary proof contribution. — | Video ID | Title | Primary Proof Contribution | |
